{
 "brief": "Prisoner affairs specialist Hassan Abdel Rabbo told Shehab Wire of an unprecedented escalation and systematic reprisal policies carried out by Israeli prison authorities under direct orders from Israeli political and security leadership. Abdel Rabbo said the deaths of roughly 100 detainees under torture require a national strategy and urgent international intervention.\n\nThe specialist described coordinated abuse across the Israeli prison system, with decisions originating at the highest levels of Israeli government and military command. He characterized the prison administration's practices as retaliatory measures executed with deliberate coordination between political officials and security chiefs, signaling a shift in the treatment of detainees held in Israeli custody.",
